- "Resolve Centre" code node: maps to_number -> {documentURL, centre_id}
  - On unknown to_number: throws so Respond node returns error
- "Get KB" fetches Google Doc dynamically via $json.documentURL
- "Build Response" wraps KB content in Retell shape
- "Respond to Webhook" returns

